  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilience in the Eastern Caribbean through Reduction of Marine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to OECS to project to combat marine litter in Eastern Caribbean. Outputs: Enhance the enabling environment and coordinating mechanisms for waste; Create an enabling environment for material recycling; Develop incentives to reduce plastics; Develop a strategy to improve the transnational movement of plastics and other waste; Develop community based interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
